                "text": "Thanks to the Affordable Care Act:\n\u2611\ufe0fPeople with pre-existing conditions are protected.\n\u2611\ufe0fInsurance companies cannot put lifetime caps on care or limit coverage.\n\u2611\ufe0fYoung adults can stay on their family\u2019s plan until they turn 26.\n\u2611\ufe0fWomen can no longer be charged more than men. https://t.co/pHoIwcMddy",
